    Fix RestDocsServletTest after removal of globalMacro map (#8421)
    
    The regression test for the XSS in the REST docs servlet expected the
    servlet to read three bundle context properties on activation. These
    reads were removed together with the unused globalMacro map (#8279).
    Both changes passed CI on their own, but combined on develop the strict
    mock verification fails.
    
    This patch removes the stale expectations from the test.
    
